        "answer": "The six arena helpers keep exact early exits and event/enum tests. CurrentArenaEventTypeEquals rejects nonpublic-arena or nil event; IsEventCompleteTimer dereferences the event without the nil guard present in IsNextEventCompleteTimer. UpdateArenaOnLobbyNav exits unless arena mode, then writes rank/event/team/storage models and populates stats. CreateArenaCards filters future-ending events, sorts them and appends only the recovered active-action branch, then may mark cards[1].featured without an empty guard. Preserve dayCount/party-count globals, scope defects and original enum/settings uncertainty.",
